{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1473616-101-plot-ideas","id":1473616,"title":"101 Plot Ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-01-30T17:40:19-08:00","id":1473616,"title":"101 Plot Ideas","content":"Lets get some plot ideas going.<br /> <br /> 1. A PC catches a man in a club trying to roofie a woman. If the PC intervenes, through some quirk of events the man ends up dying. The man turns out to be a billionaire's son, who devotes his resources towards finding his son's killer. He hires a private detective, who discovers the nature of vampires while investigating the PC. And he has friends.<br /> <br /> 2. A PC realizes he's missing chunks of time from his memory. Investigation reveals he's being Dominated to perform reconnaissance for an Elder who has recently reawoken.<br /> <br /> 3. Ghoul renegades have kidnapped and chained up a few thin bloods in the basement. They bring humans to the thin bloods to feed on, and then drain the thin bloods to feed themselves. After a few months, the disappearances start getting noticed, and its making feeding difficult, because of public awareness and increased police patrols.<br /> <br /> 4. A severe cold snap keeps people at home and away from the Racks. Homeless people stay in shelters, and nobody's going out. Blood sources are going dry, and the entire vampire population struggles to hunt.<br /> <br /> 5. A PC's former love interest never gave up looking for the PC after their death/disappearance. The love interest finally tracked them down and if the PC rebuffs them, they'll quietly investigate them, and discover their true nature. If this happens, they'll want to be made a vampire as well so they can be together forever.<br /> <br /> 6. The local Anarchs have begun aggressively recruiting Neonates and have been quite successful. The local Elders and even some Ancillae have responded by making life very difficult for Neonates, to include Sires bloodbinding their Childer, thus proving the Anarchs' point even further. If these events are allowed to continue, a Camarilla/Anarch bloodbath is right around the corner. The brainchild of this recruitment campaign is a Toreador Antitribu.<br /> <br /> 7. A Ventrue Elder Embraced a wealthy cryptocurrency investor a few years back. The Investor turned out to be a pedophile, and his preferred Herd is children. The Ventrue Elder is low enough Humanity that he doesn't see an issue with this, but its getting around and enough of the local vampire populace is getting angry.<br /> <br /> 8. A vampire gunsmith has taken to making pistol and rifle rounds that deal Aggravated Damage and is supplying some local factions over others. This tremendous power imbalance has the possibility to totally upend the power structure of the local population.<br /> <br /> 9. A Bloodhunt was called on a Sabbat infiltrator. The vampire with significant levels of Obfuscate who caught up to him Diablerized him, and the Prince waved it off. Now, other vampires are starting to notice that they are looking at them with a bit of hunger in their eyes. Paranoia is creeping through the city, but aside from the looks, the Diablerist has been on his best behavior.<br /> <br /> 10. Two rival groups of Anarch motorcycle clubs have escalated their aggression and a shootout happens at the local Rack. The Prince wants them either run off or killed, but the Anarchs have protected them, calling it an internal affair. The PC's can help to track them down and earn some Status, attempt to mediate the dispute, or help shelter the Anarchs. Both of the MC's have some very low humanity Brujah that keep instigating the fights that need to be dealt with before any peace can be made.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27252-hades","name":"Hades","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-01T04:55:00-08:00","id":1473746,"title":"","content":"11. The mother of one of the PCs is losing her battle against cancer. Her dying wish is to try to find the PC so she spends all her money on a private detective (after all, she won't need the money in a few months). Sadly, she finds out about vampires and ends up as the ghoul of one of the coterie's rivals (who uses her to blackmail the PC). He keeps her alive with his vitae, but if the PCs don't do what he wants, the opponent has no problem killing her","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27221,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27221-maddie","user":"Maddie","date":". 02-01-2022, 01:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27221-maddie","name":"Maddie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-02T15:15:32-08:00","id":1473867,"title":"","content":"12. While trying to maintain a mortal cover, at least one of the PCs is visiting a bank. Then a bank robbery happens - a bunch of armed goons burst in, screaming, shouting and intending to rob the place. The police show up quickly, and it all turns into a hostage situation. The PCs is not really threatened by this (i.e getting shot won't kill them), but at the same time they cannot easily interfere or resolve the situation without violating the Masquerade.<br /> <br /> 13. Some elder interferes with a PCs relationship - possibly with a Touchstone - just out of boredom and spite.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-02-03T04:36:44-08:00","id":1473892,"title":"","content":"14. One of the PC's benefactors or even friends turns out to be a Salubri (how it turns out, the Master can decide it). She asks the PCs for help to get her out of the city and avoid being eaten. If they do, it can be dangerous and make a few enemies. but she has helped you until then, what will the coterie do? You could also eat her yourself, I suppose.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27221,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27221-maddie","user":"Maddie","date":". 02-03-2022, 07:38 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27221-maddie","name":"Maddie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}